### ===== PROJECTS =====

### Get all projects
GET http://localhost:3000/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get recent projects
GET http://localhost:3000/projects/recent
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get pinned projects
GET http://localhost:3000/projects?pinned=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get favourite projects
GET http://localhost:3000/projects?favourite=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get single project
GET http://localhost:3000/projects/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create project
POST http://localhost:3000/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mój projekt",
  "description": "Opis projektu"
}

### Update project
PATCH http://localhost:3000/projects/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{
  "name": "Zmieniona nazwa",
  "color": "#fcba03"
}

### Delete project
DELETE http://localhost:3000/projects/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Toggle pin
PATCH http://localhost:3000/projects/1/pin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Toggle favourite
PATCH http://localhost:3000/projects/1/favourite
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== PROJECT ACCESS MANAGEMENT =====

### Lista członków projektu
GET http://localhost:3000/projects/1/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Nadaj dostęp (VIEW)
POST http://localhost:3000/projects/1/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{
  "userId": 3
}

### Nadaj dostęp (EDIT)
POST http://localhost:3000/projects/1/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{
  "userId": 5,
  "accessLevel": "EDIT"
}

### Nadaj dostęp (DELETE)
POST http://localhost:3000/projects/1/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{
  "userId": 5,
  "accessLevel": "DELETE"
}

### Odbierz dostęp
DELETE http://localhost:3000/projects/1/members/5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== TESTY BEZPIECZENSTWA =====

### Brak tokenu → 401
GET http://localhost:3000/projects

### Nieistniejący projekt → 404
GET http://localhost:3000/projects/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Nadanie dostępu bez bycia ownerem → 403
POST http://localhost:3000/projects/999/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{
  "userId": 3
}

### Toggle pin bez dostępu → 403
PATCH http://localhost:3000/projects/999/pin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}